{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "偿付不变量",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 135.08,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "借贷协议靠一条不变量运转：每个账户的抵押品，打折以后，要盖得住借款。",
   "spoken": "借贷协议靠一条不变量运转：每个账户的抵押品，打折以后，要盖得住借款。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 9.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "打折的比例，叫清算阈值。",
   "spoken": "打折的比例，叫清算阈值。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.064,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 11.162,
   "speechEnd": 13.566
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "抵押品价值乘以清算阈值，再除以借款，就是健康因子。",
   "spoken": "抵押品价值乘以清算阈值，再除以借款，就是健康因子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.62,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 14.718,
   "speechEnd": 19.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "健康因子大于 1，账户安全。小于 1，任何人都可以清算它。",
   "spoken": "健康因子大于 1，账户安全。小于 1，任何人都可以清算它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.6,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 20.698,
   "speechEnd": 26.243
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "清算，是第三方替账户偿还债务，再以折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "spoken": "清算，是第三方替账户偿环债务，再以折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 27.3,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 27.398,
   "speechEnd": 32.017
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "折扣，是给清算人的报酬。",
   "spoken": "折扣，是给清算人的报酬。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 33.088,
   "dur": 3.168,
   "speechStart": 33.186,
   "speechEnd": 35.412
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "回到 Euler。按 Omniscia 和 BlockSec 的复盘，捐赠以后，账户已经资不抵债。",
   "spoken": "回到 Euler。按 Omniscia 和 BlockSec 的复盘，捐赠以后，账户已经资不抵债。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 36.476,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 36.574,
   "speechEnd": 43.428
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "而 Euler 的清算折扣，会随资不抵债的程度变大。",
   "spoken": "而 Euler 的清算折扣，会随资不抵债的程度变大。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 44.496,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 44.594,
   "speechEnd": 47.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "攻击者用另一个账户来清算它，以很大的折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "spoken": "攻击者用另一个账户来清算它，以很大的折扣拿走抵押品。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 49.036,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 49.134,
   "speechEnd": 53.431
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "缺口越大，折扣越大。坏账，变成了利润。",
   "spoken": "缺口越大，折扣越大。坏账，变成了利润。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.488,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 54.586,
   "speechEnd": 58.881
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "整个协议也有一条不变量：所有资产，要盖得住所有存款人的债权。",
   "spoken": "整个协议也有一条不变量：所有资产，要盖得住所有存款人的债权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 59.94,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 60.038,
   "speechEnd": 65.204
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "盖不住的部分，就是坏账。",
   "spoken": "盖不住的部分，就是坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 66.256,
   "dur": 3.168,
   "speechStart": 66.354,
   "speechEnd": 68.592
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "坏账不一定来自攻击。",
   "spoken": "坏账不一定来自攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 69.644,
   "dur": 2.328,
   "speechStart": 69.742,
   "speechEnd": 71.123
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "价格暴跌，预言机延迟，清算来不及，都会留下坏账。",
   "spoken": "价格暴跌，预言机延迟，清算来不及，都会留下坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 72.192,
   "dur": 5.472,
   "speechStart": 72.29,
   "speechEnd": 76.813
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "清算人是逐利的。奖励覆盖不了 gas 和滑点，就没人清算。",
   "spoken": "清算人是逐利的。奖励覆盖不了 gas 和滑点，就没人清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 77.884,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 77.982,
   "speechEnd": 82.622
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "抵押品流动性不足，清算人拿到手，也卖不出好价钱。",
   "spoken": "抵押品流动性不足，清算人拿到手，也卖不出好价钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 83.696,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 83.794,
   "speechEnd": 88.103
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "再看一个例子。2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 Venus，允许用户拿自己的治理代币 XVS 做抵押。",
   "spoken": "再看一个例子。2021 年 5 月，BNB Chain 上的 Venus，允许用户拿自己的治理代币 XVS 做抵押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 89.148,
   "dur": 8.328,
   "speechStart": 89.246,
   "speechEnd": 96.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "按 The Block 报道，XVS 短时间里，从约 76 美元涨到约 144 美元。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 报道，XVS 短时间里，从约 76 美元涨到约 144 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 97.696,
   "dur": 6.792,
   "speechStart": 97.794,
   "speechEnd": 103.651
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "抵押能力跟着上涨，有人借走了大量 BTC 和 ETH。",
   "spoken": "抵押能力跟着上涨，有人借走了大量 BTC 和 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 104.708,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 104.806,
   "speechEnd": 108.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "XVS 回落以后，清算金额约 2 亿美元以上，仍然留下约 9500 万美元以上的坏账。",
   "spoken": "XVS 回落以后，清算金额约 2 亿美元以上，仍然留下约 9500 万美元以上的坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.608,
   "dur": 7.32,
   "speechStart": 109.706,
   "speechEnd": 116.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "项目方称，价格可能被操纵。",
   "spoken": "项目方称，价格可能被操纵。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-21.mp3",
   "start": 117.148,
   "dur": 3.168,
   "speechStart": 117.246,
   "speechEnd": 119.472
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "这叫反身性。价格上涨，借款增加，卖压增加，价格下跌，坏账出现。",
   "spoken": "这叫反身性。价格上涨，借款增加，卖压增加，价格下跌，坏账出现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-22.mp3",
   "start": 120.536,
   "dur": 7.392,
   "speechStart": 120.634,
   "speechEnd": 127.084
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "所以，低流动性的抵押品，要有供应上限和更低的抵押率。",
   "spoken": "所以，低流动性的抵押品，要有供应上限和更低的抵押率。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep11/audio/lines/seg2-23.mp3",
   "start": 128.148,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 128.246,
   "speechEnd": 133.043
  }
 ],
